/target
# cargo-fuzz build output. `fuzz/corpus/` and `fuzz/artifacts/` are tracked on
# purpose: the corpus is the seed set and the artifacts are crash regressions
# that `tests/fuzz_corpus.rs` replays on every run.
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/coverage
/artifacts
/tmp
package-lock.json
package.json
node_modules
# .claude is tracked so shared config (skills, hooks, settings.json) is available to all contributors.
# Files matching *.local.* are personal and not shared — keep them out of source control.
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/*.local.*
.idea
.local-utils
.worktrees.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
